    <li><a href="https://www.gov.uk/rest-breaks-work" rel="noopener">GOV.UK — Rest breaks at work</a></li>
    <li><a href="https://www.fairwork.gov.au/employment-conditions/hours-of-work-breaks-and-rosters" rel="noopener">Fair Work Ombudsman — Hours of work, breaks and rosters</a></li>
  </ul>
</GuideLayout>
